  {
    "insert": "Relevance and Real-World Application",
    "attributes": {
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": ": The exposé identifies a significant societal challenge and demonstrates the potential of generative AI in addressing it. The inclusion of examples, such as the CMS nursing home staffing campaign, provides context and relevance to the research.\n"
  },
  {
    "insert": "Well-Defined Research Questions",
    "attributes": {
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": ": The research questions are specific and align with the overall aim of exploring the integration of generative AI in geriatric healthcare. The focus on ethical challenges and clinician-centric design adds depth to the study.\n"
  },
  {
    "insert": "Theoretical Frameworks",
    "attributes": {
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": ": The use of system thinking and data-driven decision-making as theoretical frameworks strengthens the project’s foundation, providing a robust lens for addressing the complexity of multimorbidities.\n"
  },
